{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-yongkang-champagne-industry-and-trade-co-dot-ltd-cordless-pressure-washer-sold-via-amazon-2604-0089","content_id":"0e912369-8957-4e2c-8dbe-9df3960aa357","description":"Product Safety Report for Cordless Pressure Washer presenting a serious risk of electric shock.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"93e2a42c-4da7-4d4f-a8a5-211ad8ee616a","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-06-23T13:57:18+01:00","id":"93e2a42c-4da7-4d4f-a8a5-211ad8ee616a","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-06-23T13:57:18+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a3a82ae30b491f55b3c478f/2604-0089-product-safety-report-cordless-pressure-washer.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Yongkang Champagne Industry and Trade Co., Ltd Cordless Pressure Washer sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of electric shock because, under fault conditions, insulation may break down and cause accessible metal parts to become live.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed and the listing removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Machinery - Pressure Washers (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Manufacturer</td>\n      <td>Yongkang Champagne Industry and Trade Co., Ltd</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>TZ-C03AE</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASIN</td>\n      <td>B0FH2WJYG9</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Other product identifiers</td>\n      <td>EH1UK, RVG1995-260119-0001-47, 1501072-3, G1995-V9192574506.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Counterfeit</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A black and red cordless pressure washer gun with rechargeable battery and a wall plug for charging. The product is packaged in a brown cardboard box and is supplied with accessories including a plastic removable soap container, a submersible pump and a grey hose pipe.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_93e2a42c-4da7-4d4f-a8a5-211ad8ee616a\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a3a82ae30b491f55b3c478f/2604-0089-product-safety-report-cordless-pressure-washer.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of electric shock because the insulation may break down during normal use. If the user touches the metal part of the casing while the item is switched on and the insulation has failed, they may receive an electric shock. The transformer is of poor build quality and fails to meet the minimum required creepage and clearance distances. Improvements are required to documentations and markings.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Supply of Machinery (Safety) Regulations 2008.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2604-0089</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-20T17:11:14Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"machinery","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product","import-rejected-at-border","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-04-20","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-04-20T18:11:14+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-yongkang-champagne-industry-and-trade-co-dot-ltd-cordless-pressure-washer-sold-via-amazon-2604-0089","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-yongkang-champagne-industry-and-trade-co-dot-ltd-cordless-pressure-washer-sold-via-amazon-2604-0089","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-yongkang-champagne-industry-and-trade-co-dot-ltd-cordless-pressure-washer-sold-via-amazon-2604-0089","content_id":"0e912369-8957-4e2c-8dbe-9df3960aa357","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-04-20T17:11:14Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Yongkang Champagne Industry and Trade Co., Ltd Cordless Pressure Washer sold via Amazon (2604-0089)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-yongkang-champagne-industry-and-trade-co-dot-ltd-cordless-pressure-washer-sold-via-amazon-2604-0089","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"